2025-12-20 18:11:24,505 - ERROR - Full data: ('de26e781-16ce-4966-859a-f889d35144ef', 277293, "A Cantor's Tale", "A Cantor's Tale", 'The tradition of Eastern European Jewish cantorial music is alive and well in modern America in no small part thanks to the efforts of Brooklyn-born Cantor Jacob Mendelson. "Jackie," as he is affectionately called by everyone, explores the American roots of "hazzanut" (Jewish liturgical music) while taking us on a musical voyage that spans the Atlantic, originating in his birthplace of Boro Park, Brooklyn and reaching all the way to Jerusalem.', datetime.date(2005, 7, 25), 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'tt0374568', 'en', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 11, 14, 587962, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 11, 14, 587962, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
