2025-12-20 18:12:42,977 - ERROR - Full data: ('a0c0e69c-cf99-4b69-bf82-670f37daf9bb', 272336, 'Solos: The Jazz Sessions - Andrew Hill', 'Solos: The Jazz Sessions - Andrew Hill', "Music/Musical - Andrew Hill, a great and even groundbreaking composer and pianist exhibited a determined command of his materials, however abstract they might sometimes be. His composed melodies were labyrinthine, rhythmically and harmonically complex tunes that exhibit a sophistication born of mastery, not chance or contingency. As a pianist, Hill had a flowing melodicism and an elastic sense of time. Like his composing, Hill's playing had an ever-present air of spontaneity and was almost completely devoid of cliche.", datetime.date(2009, 1, 1), 0, 0, 0, '', '', '', 'en', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 12, 42, 196092, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 12, 42, 196092, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
