2025-12-20 18:12:43,123 - ERROR - Full data: ('b539a1e8-11f9-4eaf-be0a-0f57ed3ac441', 272337, 'Solos: The Jazz Sessions - Greg Osby', 'Solos: The Jazz Sessions - Greg Osby', 'The Jazz Sessions spotlights unaccompanied performances by some of the legends and bright young stars of the jazz world. Designed and recorded specifically for television, SOLOS offers viewers front row seats for an intimate and unique jazz experience. Saxophonist, composer, producer and educator Greg Osby has made an indelible mark on contemporary jazz as a leader of his own ensembles and as a guest artist with other acclaimed jazz groups for the past 20 years.', datetime.date(2009, 1, 1), 0, 0, 0, '', '', '', 'en', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 12, 42, 196092, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 12, 42, 196092, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
