2025-12-20 18:12:49,760 - ERROR - Full data: ('a3d22bcd-6ba6-4ff4-a134-9e65da5ec4cf', 272300, 'Into the Arms of Strangers', 'Into the Arms of Strangers', "Two years ago, Andy Barker suffered serious brain damage in a car accident. In the last two days however, memories have started creeping back, triggered by family portraits and strange locations. Andy has a brother who has gone missing and a tattooed woman introduces herself as his daughter. At a costume party he is greeted by strangers he doesn't recognize, but the horrific experience of memory loss really puts Andy's sanity to the test when he discovers a porn tape of himself. The more pieces of his life puzzle come together, the less Andy likes what he sees. Meet Andy Barker. Andy Barker just did.", datetime.date(2007, 4, 6), 93, 75000, 0, '/fQyKmN7HO2fzAUIsh766CiR4rni.jpg', '', 'tt0979900', 'en', 1.049, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 12, 42, 199124, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 12, 42, 199124, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
