2025-12-20 18:14:41,339 - ERROR - Full data: ('1c47bf4e-f21b-4210-b7b4-ba24075ada2b', 272077, 'Mastodon - Live at Brixton', 'Mastodon - Live at Brixton', "If Mastodon never get around to a greatest hits package, Live at Brixton will do the trick. Captured at a February 2012 gig in London, Brixton finds the Georgia prog-sludge mainstays barreling through 23 choice cuts from their five good-to-classic LPs, 2002's Remission through 2011's The Hunter, a typically remarkable performance from a band whose live prowess rivals their in-studio wizardry. Like most overviews, the song selection's arguable, the impact of even the highest highs altered in their uprooting. But Brixton does the same rep-cementing, catalog-calcifying work a good hits comp is supposed to, further solidifying Mastodon's spot among the greatest big-ticket metal bands going.", datetime.date(2013, 12, 10), 97, 0, 0, '/m8ZRozMxgvihT3OTrTPt3Oisv1T.jpg', '', '', 'en', 0.642, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 14, 26, 466152, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 14, 26, 466152, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
