2025-12-20 18:16:13,749 - ERROR - Full data: ('b89a70a7-9f14-4688-82d0-e497ef907266', 275378, 'Cult Witness', 'Cult Witness', 'At the age of 19 Samuel Stefan, consumed by crisis, was drawn into a cult. It would be 10 years before he was able to escape. Throughout the documentary, we hear from six others who have freed themselves from cults and share their disturbing firsthand experiences. Stefan unravels the hidden world of cults, the hold they have on their victims, the reasons people fall prey to them as well as what takes place within.', datetime.date(2010, 1, 1), 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'tt1590317', 'en', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 16, 1, 947195, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 16, 1, 947195, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
