2025-12-20 18:16:15,695 - ERROR - Full data: ('9753d938-4061-40b4-862f-162276fb2534', 275393, 'Huloo', 'Huloo', "Loo-Chi Hu was born in Yangchow, China in 1924, and before the revolution studied T'ai Chi Ch'uan, the internal Chinese martial art, under master Chen Wei-Ming, which he feels helped improve his health and guide him during his feisty teenage years. A master mariner, he worked in the fisheries business in Taiwan; then, in 1955, he was one of a crew of six who sailed on a journey across the Pacific Ocean from Taiwan to San Francisco, an adventure that made international front-page news.", datetime.date(2008, 1, 1), 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'tt1642228', 'en', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 16, 1, 947195, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 16, 1, 947195, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
