2025-12-20 18:16:16,557 - ERROR - Full data: ('fa30b748-dbb4-4867-ae5a-4a369baa6cbf', 275400, 'The Alignment Within', 'The Alignment Within', 'Are you in touch with the global and personal alignments that are happening now, at the completion of the great Mayan cycle? Do you know how to align yourself with these changes through the daily use of the Mayan calendar? This film suggests that Mayan calendar give us a practical and specific process that provides to each individual the right spiritual guidance. The Mayan calendar is the right tool to help humanity empower individuals to change their life in sync with the cosmic time flow.', datetime.date(2011, 1, 1), 0, 0, 0, '', '', '', 'en', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 16, 1, 947195, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 16, 1, 947195, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
