2025-12-20 18:16:30,340 - ERROR - Full data: ('855effd8-a1d1-48be-8909-e7278a06accf', 275000, "J'ai (très) mal au travail", "J'ai (très) mal au travail", 'Stress, harassment, violence, depression and suicide are the themes the media evoke with increasing frequency when it comes to the world of work. Jean-Michel Carré spent over a year conducting a basic investigation into how the French relate to work and the way it is organized by new management methods. The film seeks to gauge the cost in pain or pleasure when an employee manufactures, resists, creates, finds fulfilment or breaks down.', datetime.date(2007, 10, 31), 90, 0, 0, '', '', '', 'fr', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 16, 19, 920610, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 16, 19, 920610, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
