2025-12-20 18:16:40,345 - ERROR - Full data: ('b5c69ce6-e18b-4772-8fe2-ad376005d771', 275151, 'The Odds of Recovery', 'The Odds of Recovery', "After a twenty year period of multiple illnesses and injuries, the filmmaker turns the camera on herself as a way to analyze her chances for a happier, healthier life. In the process, she captures the frustration, tedium and petty annoyances of a revolving-door relationship with the medical establishment, while portraying the complicated web of emotions that accompany any medical problem. With humor and honesty, The Odds of Recovery uses the filmmaker's medical history as a means to address a perennial human problem: the desire to avoid conflict and deny the need for radical change.", datetime.date(2002, 6, 9), 66, 0, 0, '/49TXxJi11DNfjFfJjsL77RxcyRx.jpg', '', 'tt0818867', 'en', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 16, 39, 957821, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 16, 39, 957821, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
