2025-12-20 18:16:43,779 - ERROR - Full data: ('a54608ed-9395-4691-ae9c-f2a3a475e6a3', 275038, 'Redemption of Paradise', 'Redemption of Paradise', "Redemption of Paradise tells the story of Millicent Reid (Macka Diamond) a retired US army sniper who returned home to  find her beautiful Paradise Island in shambles. Finding her community over run by the notorious drug lord  Roger (Kiethroy Respect Mason and his band of cronies Millie is bent on restoring her community back to its peaceful and dignified state. She decided to take on Roger and his crew. She interrupts a few of Rogers drug deals and thus starts the feud. When Millie reported a robbery to the police it lead to the death of Young Prince- Rogers brother. Roger retaliated by killing Mill's daughter Sherrie (Keturah Hamilton) and Mill's grandson Shane. Macka herself was left wheelchair bound but swore revenge.This tragic event spiral the movie into a cat and mouse action filled game between Milli, Roger, neighboring Gangs, a Colombian Drug Lord and the entire police force. They all want Rogers head, none more so than Milli.", datetime.date(2011, 2, 18), 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'tt1784601', 'en', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', 'http://cbenpictures.wix.com/ropthemovie#!', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 16, 39, 958834, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 16, 39, 958834, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
