2025-12-20 18:17:16,052 - ERROR - Full data: ('f9b29fe3-ba20-45fc-9155-410ae340bab1', 273368, 'Sista ringen', 'Sista ringen', "Eric and Clarence are friends from the same class in school - but from different social classes. Eric comes from the working class, Clarence from the upper class. Eric regards his studies as a way of getting somewhere, while Clarence is only interested in the drawing lessons. There are only a few months left until graduation. Clarence behaves very provocatively against the art teacher 'Sjasen'. Plot by Mattias Thuresson.", datetime.date(1955, 10, 10), 92, 0, 0, '/yADie46wQ45uU8yQdduswLWpQTv.jpg', '', 'tt0048625', 'sv', 0.73, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 17, 14, 749572, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 17, 14, 749572, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
