2025-12-20 18:17:16,357 - ERROR - Full data: ('316e244d-bffe-4faf-81fc-8ba5ddd5e684', 273376, 'Fish Story', '子非魚', 'J and Jacky are good friends who attend the same school. J is from a single-parent family, and will be taken care by Jacky’s family whenever his mother has to return to Mainland to renew her visa; such kind of story is not an isolated case. These families have been uprooted for a “better future” in Hong Kong, but is this “future” that the children really long to have? A Chinese saying: “How does one understand the joy of fish, if one is not a fish?” Will the adults really understand what the children want?', datetime.date(2013, 11, 16), 72, 0, 0, '/1ZJCZO2RbFZIO7zTkz8HpLcMSu2.jpg', '', 'tt3776830', 'cn', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', 'http://www.cnex.org.hk/cnex_n.php/250.html', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 17, 14, 749572, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 17, 14, 749572, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
