2025-12-20 18:20:09,737 - ERROR - Full data: ('68ae43bb-79c1-40d9-a955-aa160bf9d5b2', 285206, 'Blow-Up', 'Blow-Up', 'The raw material used in Blow-up comprises two shots from an old educational film about first aid: A man demonstrates mouth-to-mouth resuscitation on a life-size dummy; the dummy´s chest rises and falls.  Fruhauf introduces this scene into his own métier, turning the "blow-up" metaphor into an image with a false bottom. With the aid of a digital photocopier, the strip of film was reduced in size to a narrow ribbon, and Blow-up shows this transformation in reverse.', datetime.date(2001, 10, 11), 2, 0, 0, '/moqCzL6unCiaRazvp0exj6Zj5rt.jpg', '', 'tt0306569', 'de', 0.627, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', 'https://www.siegfriedfruhauf.com/cinema/blow-up/', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 20, 7, 94964, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 20, 7, 94964, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
