2025-12-20 18:20:57,566 - ERROR - Full data: ('f6f3b4c4-1c81-4570-b44a-8883f9458fc9', 285667, 'We Imitate; We Break Up', 'We Imitate; We Break Up', '“Mario was a construction; the girl tried to imitate it. But she knew there was more that she could do.  Mario limited her.  In my imagination I saw a competitive relationship that could only go so far.  In making this film I combined the ‘real’ with the ‘constructed’, proving for myself that these two aesthetics could not fuse together; they had to remain apart working in tandem as a relationship, thus their meaning now included competition and cooperation.”  E.B.1978', datetime.date(1978, 1, 2), 23, 0, 0, '/tpUcgFCnjDLmM86Y1vgm5A52jd.jpg', '', '', 'en', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', 'http://www.erickabeckman.com/We_Imitate_We_Break_Up.html', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 20, 46, 132199, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 20, 46, 132199, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
