2025-12-20 18:20:57,841 - ERROR - Full data: ('7fbb0fd4-4546-4400-a24b-e8d6df3d458a', 285666, "Bread/Camellia's Square", 'Pane/Piazza delle Camelie', "Husband and wife Carlo and Grazia make bread in their wood-burning oven and also distribute it to the sellers. They work all night long, every day of the week, as their families used to do. They live in Gorgiti, a village in Tuscany, on the mountains near Arezzo. On the other hand, in Rome, some young people live near Camellia's Square at Centocelle, in the suburbs. We see them at different moments in their lives. Their existences seem to belong to distant and very different universes. There seems to be an irreconcilable generation conflict. The film makes use of documentary and fiction, but tries to amalgamate them while simultaneously using them as opposites.", datetime.date(2008, 1, 1), 97, 0, 0, '', '', '', 'it', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 20, 46, 132199, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 20, 46, 132199, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
