2025-12-20 18:22:11,633 - ERROR - Full data: ('fbe3ef25-e3a1-4bd9-b97c-f94a1fce3d74', 288993, 'I, Nuligak : an Inuvialuit history of first contact', 'I, Nuligak : an Inuvialuit history of first contact', 'It is easy to overlook Herschel Island – a tiny speck of land just off the Yukon coast – where the Inuvialuit hunter Nuligak once followed the great journeys of caribou, polar bears, and whales. The island lays silently on the margins of geography, entrapped in the footnotes of history, a forgotten place frozen in time.  It was on Herschel Island that a young Inuvialuit boy, Nuligak (later named Bob Cockney by the missionaries) came of age-fascinated by Herschel, but equally repelled by the excess of so-called civilization. Through Nuligak’s touching yet tragic life-story expressed through his writings and echoed by his grandchildren’s poignant return to the Island-we are offered a unique view into an often troubling past and a potentially hopeful future.', datetime.date(2005, 6, 7), 70, 0, 0, '', '', '', 'en', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 21, 58, 900367, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 21, 58, 900367, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
