2025-12-20 18:22:22,640 - ERROR - Full data: ('7101f74e-1a9a-4810-a8f2-37b40bc2048a', 289141, 'Al-yazerli', 'اليازرلي', 'Based on a novella by Hanna Mina. The film’s poetic, non-narrative structure simulates the fractured thoughts of a young boy who is forced to leave school and find work on the docks. Using minimal dialogue but evocative music and sounds, separate vignettes introduce characters the boy encounters in a single workday. The filmmaker explores the child’s vivid imaginary world while tangibly conveying the physical harshness and repressed sexuality of a life spent in poverty and manual labor.', datetime.date(1974, 1, 2), 95, 0, 0, '/qRTohI54eXK3Si9jw46ICnI3t9E.jpg', '', 'tt2099552', 'ar', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 22, 16, 37958, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 22, 16, 37958, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
