2025-12-20 18:23:21,521 - ERROR - Full data: ('d773581d-1698-4aed-8e85-20f2960e6fdf', 286954, 'Q2P', 'Q2P', 'Director Paromita Vohra\'s novel film explores the dearth of public lavatories in Mumbai, India, focusing on the scarcity of women\'s restrooms throughout the city. In looking at who has to "queue to pee," Vohra delves into other social issues such as gender, class, caste and urban growth in this incisive journey into a usually unmentionable topic. Q2P won the Grand Jury Prize for Best Documentary at the 2007 Indian Film Festival of Los Angeles.', datetime.date(2007, 1, 1), 54, 0, 0, '', '', '', 'en', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 23, 11, 413188, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 23, 11, 413188, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
