2025-12-20 18:24:20,694 - ERROR - Full data: ('47baf1a8-f86a-4f24-a548-faf74571f117', 288023, 'Welcome Aboard Toxic Airlines', 'Welcome Aboard Toxic Airlines', 'The film tells the very real and ongoing story of what many claim is the biggest cover up in aviation history. Passengers and crews for nearly fifty years have been supplied with unfiltered air to breath, taken directly from the engines, even though this air supply is known to sometimes become contaminated with neurotoxins, carcinogens and other hazardous chemicals.', datetime.date(2007, 11, 23), 91, 0, 0, '', '', 'tt1142585', 'en', 0.655, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 24, 11, 503749, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 24, 11, 503749, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
