2025-12-20 18:25:13,609 - ERROR - Full data: ('0640534d-f2a6-4bd6-9c9a-d51c5e52db0c', 281297, 'The Empty Center', 'Die Leere Mitte', 'Steyerl’s film traces the impact of an influx of transnational companies on the city dwellers of Berlin in post-reunification Germany. The effect of the changing economy and politics on the city and its inhabitants is echoed through their physical relocation to its outer edges. In 1990, squatters proclaim a socialist republic on the death strip. Eight years later, the new headquarters of Mercedes Benz are built in the same location. The film makes use of slow super-impositions to uncover a journey across changing architectural and cultural boundaries. "The Empty Centre" tries to give a voice and a history to those who continue to be marginalised by the simultaneous dismantling and reconstruction of the borders which they are trying to cross.', datetime.date(1998, 1, 1), 62, 0, 0, '/c3CCI84RRWL0qAEHuexsda9VJc3.jpg', '', 'tt17555366', 'de', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 25, 6, 956203, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 25, 6, 956203, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
