2025-12-20 18:26:51,974 - ERROR - Full data: ('55b35dc8-8373-4262-abc8-69c9bd5267d0', 279938, 'The Official 1993 NBA World Championship Video - Three-Peat', 'The Official 1993 NBA World Championship Video - Three-Peat', "Relive the Chicago Bulls' dramatic charge to a historic third consecutive NBA Championship, with this unique, behind-the-scenes look at their 1992-93 NBA season. Join the Bulls on the court, in the huddle, and in the locker room as they become only the third team in history to win three straight NBA finals. More than just a highlight tape, this personal profile will provide an intimate look at Michael Jordan, Scottie Pippen, Horace Grant, rising star B.J. Armstrong, and coaching great Phil Jackson as they face the toughest challenges that the league has to offer on their incredible journey into the NBA record books!", datetime.date(1993, 7, 2), 0, 0, 0, '', '', '', 'en', 0.931, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 26, 38, 430292, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 26, 38, 430292, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
