2025-12-20 18:27:25,787 - ERROR - Full data: ('0a53a955-6c54-41c2-ac40-bf4700d75c40', 280689, 'Meni', 'Meni', 'A girl dancing, repeated movements; Two layers of film superimposed and shifting in a complex rhythm, accompanied by an African drum. The making of MENI consisted of an obsessive unraveling of a series of dance movements. The movements were cut into very short fragments (0.5 to 1.5 seconds). These fragments are edited into repeating patterns. Through exchanging fragments and double exposure the film becomes an intriguing and complex rhythm.', datetime.date(1994, 1, 1), 3, 0, 0, '/8gYzBSXckROuJMntWzEzAvkqo9Z.jpg', '', 'tt0110494', 'de', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 27, 13, 259633, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 27, 13, 259633, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
