2025-12-20 18:28:07,163 - ERROR - Full data: ('472e3f27-32f0-4c35-be47-403233d67d7c', 283570, "Sneakin' and Peekin'", "Sneakin' and Peekin'", 'We traveled to Indiana back roads to see and shoot the annual Miss Nude Universe Contest held at a “notorious” nudist camp. They wanted $15 a head at the gate so we parked down the road and crawled through the brush. Once in, we encountered truckers and hundreds of Sunday photographers straining for a shot at the contestants. Afterward we joined the quest for stray women willing to pose. After a quick success we headed home with our catch in the can.', datetime.date(1976, 8, 21), 15, 0, 0, '/8wwRtzrbfUoGSLYHIEN8b40E53O.jpg', '', 'tt0152490', 'en', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 28, 5, 59343, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 28, 5, 59343, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
