2025-12-20 18:29:06,700 - ERROR - Full data: ('c2897396-c756-4897-b5c3-8c0c7bec32a7', 284281, '46664: The Event', '46664: The Event', "Named after the prison number of Nelson Mandela when he was held on Robben Island, the 46664 campaign aims to raise awareness of the HIV/AIDS epidemic in Africa to the rest of the world. The 46664 concert was held on November 29th 2003 in Cape Town and includes performances from global stars such as: Queen, Beyonce, Peter Gabriel and Ms Dynamite.  The concert for Nelson Mandela's 46664 campaign, held on 29th November 2003 at Green Point Stadium, Cape Town. Tracklisting includes Beyonce - 'Crazy In Love', Paul Oakenfold - 'Starry Eyed Surprise', Queen - 'The Show Must Go On', The Corrs - 'Breathless', Eurythmics - 'Sweet Dreams', Ms. Dynamite - 'It Takes More', Bono and The Edge - 'One'.", datetime.date(2004, 4, 13), 250, 0, 0, '/oh0CJZmIEtI0sNlUYnt8GHJP2MR.jpg', '', '', 'en', 0.633, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 28, 48, 938756, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 28, 48, 938756, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
