2025-12-20 18:29:23,357 - ERROR - Full data: ('3de8b835-dc77-4ea1-ad00-26bab2b22ac1', 284347, 'A Style of Men in Beijing', '北漂鱼 A Style of Men in Beijing', 'The movie is about a group of ‘floaters’ in Beijing ?people who live and work in Beijing but are not native residents. It is rare for a Beijing floater to have a fixed home, as they move from place to place according to their job requirements. Many Beijing floaters do not feel a sense of belonging. The movie tells the story of Yu Xiaobao, a floater who is trying to hide the reality of his struggling life from his daughter who still lives in their hometown. As a result, he tells her that he has become a film director. When his daughter suddenly decides to visit him, he enlists the help of his other floater friends to put on a show so that she does not find out the truth.', datetime.date(2013, 6, 10), 88, 0, 0, '/vDNNhk1VOesL75VWobUY13aMtjC.jpg', '', '', 'en', 0.608, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 29, 12, 54431, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 29, 12, 54431, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
