2025-12-20 18:29:30,610 - ERROR - Full data: ('90fc68fc-6bcb-4b45-a706-d62afc19b29d', 282721, 'Friendly Witness', 'Friendly Witness', 'In Friendly Witness, Sonbert returned, after 20 years, to sound. In the first section of the film, he deftly edits a swirling montage of images - suggestive of loves gained and love lost--to the tunes of four rock songs. Fred Camper said, "At times the words of the songs seem to relate directly to the images we see...; at other times words and images seem to be working almost at cross-purposes or relating only ironically. Similarly, at times the image rhythm and music rhythm appear to dance together, while at others they go their separate ways." -- Jon Gartenberg', datetime.date(1989, 1, 1), 22, 0, 0, '/5GawzBQ4hFwoONJoS5iJEEfp1mI.jpg', '', 'tt3145052', 'en', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 29, 12, 57433, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 29, 12, 57433, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
