2025-12-20 18:29:48,440 - ERROR - Full data: ('117acdba-1e17-40fb-bf99-50d13bab954a', 282844, 'Concrete Countertops DIY', 'Concrete Countertops DIY', 'Fu-Tung Cheng has become internationally known for his sophisticated, understated design and innovative use of concrete in the home. Cheng’s first book, "Concrete Countertops: Design, Forms, and Finishes for the New Kitchen and Bath" (Taunton Press, 2002), has become the authoritative, bestselling guide on how to build a concrete countertop from start to finish. Concrete Countertops tops remodeling lists nationwide and is the perfect companion to Cheng’s DVD title, "Concrete Countertops DIY" for making beautiful concrete countertops.', None, 110, 0, 0, '', '', '', 'en', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', 'http://www.concreteexchange.com/', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 29, 30, 790372, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 29, 30, 790372, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
