2025-12-20 18:31:47,402 - ERROR - Full data: ('d0aacceb-2949-49ac-8a0e-38db674b128b', 326399, 'Sexwork, Love & Mr Right', 'Sexwork, Love & Mr Right', "Amsterdam's world-famous red-light district is the fascinating backdrop to the story of plucky prostitute Lina as she searches for Mr Right. Lina thinks she has found true love with American punter Sean, but she may be treading a fine line between fantasy and reality. Could Sean be her Prince Charming or will she end up heartbroken? With hard-won access to this notoriously secretive, hidden world, Sexwork, Love & Mr Right will be a revealing and thought-provoking documentary with multiple supporting narratives from experienced punters to wise madams. As streetwise sexworker Lina navigates the highs and lows of her precarious new relationship, the film asks can sexworkers ever really find true love?", datetime.date(2013, 10, 1), 54, 0, 0, '/oCRVo2EXkLyAalwVAidtCGydBiF.jpg', '', 'tt2820708', 'en', 0.881, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', 'https://claresturges.co.uk/sexworklovemrright', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 31, 42, 836384, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 31, 42, 836384, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
