2025-12-20 18:31:47,547 - ERROR - Full data: ('e2b9407e-09ce-4dbf-a60c-ab9c5ebacb49', 326401, 'Landmarks of Western Art: Romanticism - A Journey of Art History Across The Ages', 'Landmarks of Western Art: Romanticism - A Journey of Art History Across The Ages', 'As the strict classical disciplines of the eighteenth century began to fade, two very different movements came to prominence: from Constable and Turner influenced by nature, through to the stirring works of Goya and Gericault. This episode explores the genius of works such as The Third of May and The Haywain.', None, 0, 0, 0, '', '', '', 'en', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 31, 42, 836384, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 31, 42, 836384, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
