2025-12-20 18:32:21,829 - ERROR - Full data: ('0cf0f4ba-75d7-4841-ba09-d393a4ce7353', 326274, 'Zemene', 'Zemene', 'Zemene is a shy 10-year-old living in rural Ethiopia with a rare, life-threatening, curvature of the spine that limits her world, when a chance encounter with an American doctor enables her to secure medical attention. With her physical limitations lifted, and the confirmation that her life matters, she blossoms into a confident young woman, using her newly found capabilities to bring hope back to her village. Gorgeously filmed in the Ethiopian countryside, Zemene is a poignant testament to the strength of the human spirit – and a powerful depiction of how much impact one person can have on another’s life. - Pia Chamberlain', datetime.date(2014, 2, 24), 68, 0, 0, '', '', 'tt4129604', 'en', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 32, 18, 213022, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 32, 18, 213022, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
