2025-12-20 18:33:04,465 - ERROR - Full data: ('fb1ae8ee-e4a6-43d7-8ed4-24fb196425cc', 324919, 'Gettysburg - An American Story', 'Gettysburg - An American Story', 'The 1st Minnesota Volunteer Infantry Regiment fought bravely and gallantly during the Civil War. Their regiment was the first to sign up for the Union army and arrived at Gettysburg with less than 300 survivors. Many more would sacrifice their lives there as the men of the 1st Minnesota were twice at the center of a battle that decided America?s future. As the US commemorates the 150 year anniversary of Gettysburg, HUSH follows their journey from 1861 to 1865, through the milestones of the Civil War into the deciding battles of the historic conflict, and asks: What was the war really all about? What role did slavery and civil rights play in the conflict? What did the brave men and women fight for, and why is it still relevant to American politics and society today.', datetime.date(2014, 10, 24), 0, 0, 0, '', '', '', 'en', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 32, 48, 315777, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 32, 48, 315777, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
