2025-12-20 18:33:08,583 - ERROR - Full data: ('df0feba8-2646-4048-9a41-765a954f8724', 324610, 'Vh1 Rock Docs: Yo! The Story of Yo! MTV Raps', 'Vh1 Rock Docs: Yo! The Story of Yo! MTV Raps', '"Yo: The Story of Yo! MTV Raps” takes a provocative look into the seven-year history of the series that gave hip-hop a voice and broke color barriers, integrating MTV with rap. Yo! MTV Raps premiered on August 6, 1988 with hosts Fab 5 Freddy, Ed Lover and Dr. Dre and shaped the careers of many of today’s hip-hop superstars, while simultaneously making groundbreaking strides in introducing hip-hop to the mainstream. Featuring clips and uncensored moments, the VH1 Rock Doc “Yo: The Story of Yo! MTV Raps” includes interviews with hip hop stars including: Treach (Naughty by Nature), Darryl “DMC” McDaniels (Run DMC), Questlove (The Roots), Chris “Kid” Reid and DJ Wiz (Kid N Play), Rakim, Big Daddy Kane and more.', datetime.date(2012, 6, 7), 41, 0, 0, '', '', 'tt2798584', 'en', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 32, 48, 316775, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 32, 48, 316775, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
