2025-12-20 18:33:26,165 - ERROR - Full data: ('9f0e9154-33a2-4215-b5d6-4fe462845162', 324685, 'This Gigantic Furrowing of the Ground', 'Ce gigantesque retournement de la terre', 'Normandy is a place steeped in history – after the Allied landings on 6th June 1944, it became one of the Second World War’s most hotly contested territories. Making direct reference to Jean Grémillon’s film Le six juin à l’aube, which was shot in 1944/5 under the direct influence of the total destruction of the region, this documentary essay carries out an inspection in search of the traces left behind by history 70 years later.', datetime.date(2015, 2, 10), 71, 0, 0, '', '', 'tt4544510', 'fr', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 33, 10, 488468, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 33, 10, 488468, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
