2025-12-20 18:33:26,315 - ERROR - Full data: ('f437637c-9faf-427f-a299-0afaf4f21570', 324686, 'Flotel Europa', 'Flotel Europa', 'When this film’s director was still a boy, he stood in front of “Flotel Europa“ and was hugely excited about the prospect of this gigantic ship moored in the port of Copenhagen becoming a new home for him, his mother and his older brother. Together with about 1000 other refugees from the former Yugoslavia, they started life anew on the ship.', datetime.date(2015, 2, 10), 70, 0, 0, '', '', 'tt4471392', 'da', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 33, 10, 488468, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 33, 10, 488468, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
