2025-12-20 18:33:27,006 - ERROR - Full data: ('2b8449a3-82cd-417a-a78c-546421144a0e', 325471, 'Place', 'Place', 'PLACE is a sensational dance film, specially created for two world famous dancers, Mihkail Baryshnikov and Anna Laguna by a truly international team of outstanding artists. It is choreographed by Mats Ek, considered one of the top choreographers in the world, and it is directed by a Grammy, MTV and Cannes Grand Prix award winning Swedish film director Jonas Åkerlund. Jonas is well known for his collaboration with Madonna, U2, the Rolling Stones, Metallica, Paul McCartney, Ozzy Osbourne, Robbie Williams and Christina Aguilera, to name a few.', datetime.date(2012, 3, 26), 0, 0, 0, '', '', '', 'en', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 33, 10, 488468, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 33, 10, 488468, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
