2025-12-20 18:33:27,318 - ERROR - Full data: ('43be1f5c-17c4-4fd1-8d11-445b9acb1e0a', 325298, 'Black Guy On A Rampage', 'Black Guy On A Rampage', 'A quiet Sunday night at Rightman\'s Bar and Restaurant when "he" walks in, a black ex-military man carrying a military issued duffel bag. He appears to be unemployed, homeless and dirty. As his origins become clearer, his anger begins to fuel when he realizes he has entered the same restaurant where one of the men responsible for the death of his son is eating.', datetime.date(2011, 9, 26), 0, 0, 0, '', '', '', 'en', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 33, 10, 488468, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 33, 10, 488468, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
