2025-12-20 18:33:28,053 - ERROR - Full data: ('7335e7ed-722c-43bc-b37d-ec8571f55d24', 325304, 'Historic Time Travel Wars Of The World', 'Historic Time Travel Wars Of The World', "A Historic Video that probes the consequences of wars, how they destroy entire populations and cities in fractions of seconds. The aftermath of wars and the manner in which they change the lives of survivors and their lifestyles. A high quality product proving that it's not state-of-the-art technology alone that makes for hard hitting films.Included here, among others, you will find the atomic bomb tests on Bikini Island in the Pacific, the nuclear death which destroyed the people and cities of Hiroshima and Nagasaki, and glimpses of the Korean War.This vintage collection of Black &amp;White, World War-II films has contributions from producers ranging from the U.S. War Department, Handy (Jam) Organization, and Warner News.", datetime.date(2004, 1, 1), 0, 0, 0, '', '', '', 'en', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 33, 27, 318787, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 33, 27, 318787, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
