2025-12-20 18:33:34,791 - ERROR - Full data: ('2fa007c3-e142-4884-b556-880b00e41219', 325273, 'Do What You Love: A Path to Passionate Living', 'Do What You Love: A Path to Passionate Living', "A Spiritual Documentary about living your passion. We follow the life of Keith Blanchard, writer of 'The Divine Principle,' talk to people who've read his book and been influenced by his life. Keith also speaks to people he's never met to find out if they are living their passion. This documentary is meant to show you by example, that it is possible to enjoy what you do every day, by finding the one thing or several things which you are truly passionate about in life.", datetime.date(2014, 6, 11), 0, 0, 0, '', '', '', 'en', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 33, 27, 320293, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 33, 27, 320293, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
