2025-12-20 18:33:35,491 - ERROR - Full data: ('d48acf8d-6c05-44e7-972d-9640985636b8', 325281, 'Historic Travel US Many Faces Of California', 'Historic Travel US Many Faces Of California', 'Ever since the gold fever died down and men discovered that California had much more to offer than just gold, people have thronged to this golden state which is sometimes jokingly referred to as the "state of fruits and nuts". A booming economy, availability of jobs and a pleasant climate have ensured that there are few dull moments when you are in California. The films on this Video offer a rare and historic glimpse of life in this "Golden State".', datetime.date(2005, 1, 1), 0, 0, 0, '', '', '', 'en', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 33, 27, 320293, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 33, 27, 320293, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
