2025-12-20 18:33:35,797 - ERROR - Full data: ('f4bea249-e987-4a3d-8a0e-fea309169844', 325284, 'Historic Travel US Michigan Memoirs', 'Historic Travel US Michigan Memoirs', 'The city of Detroit did more than just producing quality automobiles-it offered an enchanting life to its citizens full of hype and excitement. This rare Video contains some fascinating films, which go a long way in helping you understand what drew millions of people to Detroit.', datetime.date(2005, 1, 5), 0, 0, 0, '', '', '', 'en', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 33, 27, 320293, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 33, 27, 320293, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
