2025-12-20 18:33:57,483 - ERROR - Full data: ('e9b26244-0252-4106-a785-5b6134115523', 325010, 'Chitrangada: The Crowning Wish', 'Chitrangada: The Crowning Wish', 'Rudra Chatterjee (Rituparno Ghosh), as a young man defied the social convention, and became a choreographer instead of an engineer. As he prepares with his team to stage Tagore\'s Chitrangada, he meets Partho (Jisshu Sengupta), who is a drug-addict percussionist introduced to the team by the main dancer Kasturi (Raima Sen). Soon, Rudra develops a chemistry with Partho and they are deep in a passionate love affair. During the course of their relationship, they decide to adopt a child. But there is one problem; same-sex couples are not permitted to adopt children. So Rudra decides to go through a gender change treatment to embrace the womanhood he longs for. But will this surgery change his life and fulfill all his long-cherished dreams? A \'film-within-film\' only this time the film-within is Tagore\'s epochal epic Chitrangada - "our identity is what we wish to be".', datetime.date(2015, 1, 1), 0, 0, 0, '', '', '', 'en', 0.807, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 33, 44, 214597, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 33, 44, 214597, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
