2025-12-20 18:34:14,828 - ERROR - Full data: ('3eed5adb-f51f-4cb9-8806-08792d0a1652', 328221, 'Answers', 'Answers', 'Three of Ernest Thompson\'s short plays are presented, each involving a surprise visitor. In the first, "A Good Time," a vacationing California Highway Patrolman visits a young woman in New York who had told him if he ever came to New York, she\'d show him a good time. In the second, "The Constituent," a United States Senator drops in on a constituent who has been sending him scathing and profane letters for decades. Lastly, in "Twinkle, Twinkle," a restless housewife who has been writing fan letters to a television soap opera star, receives a surprise visit by him on her husband\'s bowling night.', datetime.date(1985, 1, 1), 116, 0, 0, '/yw4tbg4D2wNRuX64QNs0rbvLZtC.jpg', '', 'tt2818698', 'en', 0.989, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 34, 3, 768697, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 34, 3, 768697, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
