2025-12-20 18:34:23,481 - ERROR - Full data: ('56693581-e221-43af-95e7-eec7913e8ed3', 328321, 'Captain Fly-by-Night', 'Captain Fly-by-Night', "First one stranger, then another, arrive at the presidio, each with a government pass and each claiming to have been robbed by the notorious Captain Fly-by-Night and his highwaymen. The soldiers and Señorita Anita believe the first to be Fly-by-Night and the second to be Señor Rocha, Anita's fiancée and emissary of the governor. But the first stranger, to whom Anita is drawn, proves to be on a government mission and exposes the second stranger as Captain Fly-by-Night.", datetime.date(1922, 12, 24), 50, 0, 0, '/7w1Np5c6UtgUc6APnK8cbYesv3o.jpg', '/oK6uSNYvKS0ScePe4Px5VoTWi8j.jpg', 'tt0012997', 'en', 0.928, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 34, 21, 724157, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 34, 21, 724157, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
