2025-12-20 18:34:55,689 - ERROR - Full data: ('4623d21c-87e7-4017-8001-bec7549ed308', 328002, 'Reconstructions 1952-1976', 'Rekonstrukcije 1952-1976', 'A reconstructed view of the surroundings I had as a child. I place the camera in the space at different levels corresponding to different stages in my life as I grew up. Constant camera movements show objects from extreme close-up, a perspective alien to the eye opening up a microcosm which remains hidden to the normal observer.', datetime.date(1976, 1, 1), 8, 0, 0, '', '', '', 'sh', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 34, 39, 973326, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 34, 39, 973326, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
