2025-12-20 18:35:30,844 - ERROR - Full data: ('c0a8b10a-e4bf-4c98-b2fd-a3ab5420a611', 328447, 'Judy and Liza at the Palladium', 'Judy and Liza at the Palladium', "This classic show was one of Judy's last appearances at the historic Palladium Theatre in London. This unforgettable night also marked a young Liza Minelli's first public stage performance with her legendary mother. Witness Garland's exquisite talent as she performs the most-loved songs of her career while a budding Liza Minnelli more than holds her own offering a glimpse of the performative talent that would eventually launch a stunning career of her own.", datetime.date(1964, 12, 1), 54, 0, 0, '/zOG7IPtFveSEyBEulOYebZhkK0Q.jpg', '', 'tt0347291', 'en', 0.635, 0.0, 0, 'Released', 'Judy Garland and Liza Minnelli in their only filmed concert appearances together.', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 35, 19, 272368, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 35, 19, 272368, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
