2025-12-20 18:35:32,795 - ERROR - Full data: ('1c6fb458-d53a-4e3e-91f8-31b5e79ac417', 328462, 'Voluptuous Sleep', 'Voluptuous Sleep', '“Betzy Bromberg’s Voluptuous Sleep is a mesmerizing two-part 16mm meditation on the nuances of light, sound and feeling as evoked through the poetic artifices of cinema. Bromberg’s close-up lens becomes a tool of infinite discovery that reveals as much about our bodily sensations as it does the natural world. Combined with intricate and perfectly matched soundtracks, Voluptuous Sleep is a rapturous, re-centring antidote to the fragmentation of modern life and offers a new experience of cinematic time and memory. It is also an emotional tour de force.” -Steve Anker, Redcat', datetime.date(2011, 10, 8), 95, 0, 0, '/nAtQKktZFKmIA6sfFtmNMeFggkU.jpg', '/cGKZv1O5drwWa1fLTYyhFnOJx6g.jpg', 'tt2371511', 'xx', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', 'https://lux.org.uk/work/voluptuous-sleep/', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 35, 19, 272368, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 35, 19, 272368, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
