2025-12-20 18:35:37,247 - ERROR - Full data: ('fad9a88e-801e-484c-8221-f583ebebe20b', 328588, 'White Slave Ship', "L'ammutinamento", 'The Albatross travels from England to the New World in 1675, with a number of passengers, a couple of political prisoners along with a dozen other women convicts, these to be sold into slavery on arrival. The woman activist frees the dozen of low-cast women, and they take over the ship. After a storm, the captain takes back control of his ship. Since mutiny is punishable by death in the New World, the mutineers try to reroute the course, tossing Desny and Purdom in the brig. A practical male mutineer wants to throw the women overboard to save rations, but the women free Purdom and the captain to battle the mutineers. A British warship comes to the rescue, and the captain pardons Angeli and Purdom for having saved his life.', datetime.date(1961, 12, 1), 98, 0, 0, '/rvRqWCkf1HECWnTqAZOh1p5ZJeU.jpg', '/6ekF8xybV3w93UlShJwLaek3pyi.jpg', 'tt0055744', 'it', 2.12, 0.0, 0, 'Released', 'Caged in a Black Pit of Horror... 13 Women Journey to a Living Hell!', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 35, 19, 272368, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 35, 19, 272368, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
