2025-12-20 18:35:39,908 - ERROR - Full data: ('5d56b030-2e3d-412c-8220-330e73722d95', 328512, 'The Hidden Face of Suicide', 'The Hidden Face of Suicide', 'The Hidden Face of Suicide enters the world of survivors, those who have lost loved ones to suicide, and reveals their remarkable stories. Looking for the story behind the silence in her own family, Silverman sets out on a journey of understanding and transformation. Using masks, the survivors find a unique and creative way to express the unspeakable. Their journey brings to light the danger of secrets and the terrible cost of silence.', datetime.date(2015, 1, 9), 0, 0, 0, '/lXjah9Bs7QZWtu0gpAAN1LcfEMq.jpg', '', '', 'en', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 35, 38, 743922, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 35, 38, 743922, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
