2025-12-20 18:35:46,949 - ERROR - Full data: ('c96434de-d8a2-4cdf-91c6-31db957d576f', 327001, 'Havoc #8', 'Havoc #8', "Based on over 1000 hours of original material shot by dozens of cameramen at world-wide events, Havoc 8 will surprise, shock and entertain you like no other video because all the incidents actually happened! Rallies, sportscar racing, motorcycle road racing, motocross, single seaters, a caravan Destruction Derby (!), snow-scooters and European Rally Cross Championship are all featured in some not so glorious but often gloriously funny moments. And to cap it all, there's a very special dose of stuntmania running throughout. Even if you've never visited a powersport event you're sure to find Havoc 8 rivetting, funny, shocking and above all compulsive viewing!", datetime.date(2012, 2, 23), 60, 0, 0, '', '', '', 'en', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 35, 38, 745423, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 35, 38, 745423, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
