2025-12-20 18:35:47,999 - ERROR - Full data: ('bdd335dc-6f50-4155-adf2-81f15004ca1b', 327009, 'Havoc #14', 'Havoc #14', 'Over 200 of the biggest, most embarrassing, un-be-*$@!*!*-lievable ‘incidents’ from top-class Nineties powersport, from which the unfortunate competitors - miraculously - got up and walked away! International rally, sports cars, saloon car, single-seater and motocross madness are just some of the crazy wheel-mashing powersports you’ll see here taking a hammering as their drivers and riders spin, dive, slam, crunch and somersault their way into the annals of motorsport mayhem. There’s also loads of great, rarely-seen disasters from the archives and tons of on-board camera footage that give you an idea what it really feels like to see the ground coming up to meet you at over 100 mph!', datetime.date(2012, 2, 23), 63, 0, 0, '', '', '', 'en', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 35, 38, 746430, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 35, 38, 746430, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
