2025-12-20 18:35:52,891 - ERROR - Full data: ('56e84cb8-3ef0-40f4-a9e6-933a608f6a2c', 326914, 'Rainy Season', 'Rainy Season', "RAINY SEASON is an intimate story about a family's unexpected change of fate, set in the larger context of post-war Vietnam. A rubber tree farming family comes to grips with their changed lives after their youngest son finds a leftover American mortar. With unprecedented access in rural Vietnam -- shot over five years under the radar of the Vietnamese government -- RAINY SEASON captures the land's sumptuous beauty and reveals the sorrows that it harbors.", datetime.date(2013, 1, 1), 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'tt1958000', 'en', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 35, 38, 747430, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 35, 38, 747430, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
