2025-12-20 18:35:53,476 - ERROR - Full data: ('0da49f81-bdee-44ec-8313-22cab75c2857', 326920, 'Unsolved Mysteries Volume 1: UFOs', 'Unsolved Mysteries Volume 1: UFOs', 'First Look Studios released six theme-based DVD sets of "Unsolved Mysteries" in Region 1 in 2004/2005. The sets were re-released on June 21, 2005 with a lower suggested retail price. On March 21, 2006, a compilation set called The Best of Unsolved Mysteries was released, which contained selected segments from each of the earlier DVD sets along with some previously unreleased-on-DVD content. A special boxed set featuring the first six sets along with the new content from the Best of collection was also produced.  List of DVD sets ---&gt; Volume 1: UFOs,  Volume 2: Ghosts,  Volume 3: Miracles,  Volume 4: Bizarre Murder,  Volume 5: Psychics,  Volume 6: Strange Legends,  The Best of,  The Ultimate Collection.', datetime.date(2004, 9, 7), 0, 0, 0, '', '', '', 'en', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', 'http://unsolved.com/', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 35, 38, 747430, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 35, 38, 747430, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
