2025-12-20 18:35:58,646 - ERROR - Full data: ('97d5ac28-ba04-4913-841c-bb6bf60265d5', 327126, 'Ryan Mcginness: Studio Process', 'Ryan Mcginness: Studio Process', "Ryan McGinness has been coined as the Andy Warhol of our time. He's also been called a God, a leader of the new semiotics, and a pioneer of the contemporary art movement. Ryan McGinness: Studio Process, unveils the creative process and highlights Ryan McGinness at work. To witness McGinness at work in his studio is meditative and hypnotic, a complete contrast from the multi-layered work he is well known for. From iconic silkscreen graphics to black light paintings, McGinness creates a hybrid of experiences that move beyond the traditional canvas platform. A modern inventor in many respects, Ryan McGinness uses technology and the traditional method of silk-screening to create meditative experiences that reconstitute the meaning of beauty and timelessness.", datetime.date(2014, 1, 1), 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'tt4040770', 'en', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 35, 55, 843286, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 35, 55, 843286, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
