2025-12-20 18:36:16,159 - ERROR - Full data: ('cd75a83b-a8b9-4e6e-a3ca-e7147d6fe0ae', 326614, 'Five Is Too Many', '다섯은 너무 많아', "Dong-kyu has a truly curious job: collecting proof to denounce the free distribution of plastic bags. In a take-away restaurant he is caught off-guard by Sinae, an employee who runs after him and hits him on the head. Dong-kyu comes to and pretends he's amnesic. Si-nae takes him to her home, marking the beginning of a strange company of five.", datetime.date(2005, 11, 25), 80, 0, 0, '', '', 'tt0494678', 'ko', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', '', '', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 36, 13, 626328, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 36, 13, 626328, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
