2025-12-20 18:36:16,736 - ERROR - Full data: ('fb6923d3-db74-486a-946b-4e9f5a1a0dd7', 326621, 'Rue de Blues - Postcards From Provence', 'Rue de Blues - Postcards From Provence', "This documentary looks into the life of a musician who has traded one continent (and its history) for another, while never losing sight of his music. The film weaves Mr. Blair's story with glimpses of the beautiful Provence region where the swing of New Orleans and brilliant hues of the south of France come together.", datetime.date(2001, 1, 1), 30, 0, 0, '', '', '', 'en', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', 'Introducing New Orleans born Leonard Blair. A gifted singer and saxophonist who plays old style jazz with his trio, Gig Street, in the open air markets in Provence, France.', 'http://slowfilms.com/', False, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 36, 13, 626328, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 36, 13, 626328, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
