2025-12-20 18:36:54,807 - ERROR - Full data: ('eaa42f5e-8ee1-40ac-82f3-963074ac6378', 327364, 'Wet for Women', 'Wet for Women', "Wet for Women begins with the divorce of Mindi from her wealthy husband. It's heart breaking for her daughters Tara and Scarlet, so Mindi comes up with a solution-they can afford to stay in the house if they take on roommates, which would require the two girls sharing a room. Cue RayVeness and her young lesbian girlfriend (Jodi) and their mutual lesbian friend (Aidra); the three are moving to town. They find Mindi's ad for roommates on NetSkirts.com and feel it's just what they need, except that the ad states that the roommates must be a mom and her daughters. RayVeness decides to take a look at the place and if it is as good as it sounds, they will pose as a family-a little white lie.", datetime.date(2015, 2, 2), 201, 0, 0, '/6oy7JcbsS4T7KnO1fMT0w7sC3ez.jpg', '', '', 'en', 0.6, 0.0, 0, 'Released', 'A woman and her women... think of the possibilities!', '', True, False, datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 36, 48, 897950, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), datetime.datetime(2025, 12, 20, 15, 36, 48, 897950, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc))
